OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMP to challenge 'ill-thought'
OL,4,AShakespeare move
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is shocking and upsetting news
OL,7,Ffor our town, which has deep
OL,8,Fconnections with the institute. Its
OL,9,Fpresence contributes not only to the
OL,10,Fcultural life of Stratford, but also to
OL,11,Fthe local economy," she said.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
